          "settings": {
            "title": "On sleeping bags, some areas appear dark. Is this mold or dirt?",
            "answer": "<p>This is because the fabric used is thin, so the down and inner fabric are visible through it. Please rest assured that this is not mold. Areas with more down appear white, while areas where the down is naturally sparse or has shifted can appear dark. Try smoothing the down out evenly, as this should resolve the issue.</p>"
