            "answer": "<p>Down can shift depending on how the item is worn in the same position over time, or how it is stored. Laying the item flat and spreading the down out, or gently patting it to redistribute it, can help correct this. If you have used the item for a long time, the down may also be dirty, so please consider having it cleaned.</p>"
